pen-source AI agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"AI Skills Manager\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/ai-skills-manager\",\n    \"description\": \"One desktop app to browse, install, enable, and share AI agent skills across all major coding agents.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-20\",\n    \"category\": \"AI workflow automation\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"JetBrains Air\",\n    \"url\": \"https://blog.jetbrains.com/air/2026/03/air-launches-as-public-preview-a-new-wave-of-dev-tooling-built-on-26-years-of-experience/\",\n    \"description\": \"Agentic development environment that allows delegating coding tasks to multiple AI agents that can run concurrently. Built on 26 years of JetBrains development experience.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-16\",\n    \"category\": \"AI IDE\",\n    \"sources\": [\"JetBrains Blog\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Junie CLI\",\n    \"url\": \"https://blog.jetbrains.com/air/2026/03/air-launches-as-public-preview-a-new-wave-of-dev-tooling-built-on-26-years-of-experience/\",\n    \"description\": \"JetBrains' AI coding assistant CLI that understands existing project context and provides everyday development task support.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-10\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"JetBrains Blog\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"assistant-ui react-ink\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.assistant-ui.com/blog/2026-03-launch-week\",\n    \"description\": \"Terminal UI bindings powered by Ink for building AI chat interfaces in the terminal - launches in March 2026.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-11\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Official Blog\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ProductBridge\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/productbridge\",\n    \"description\": \"AI agent that automatically collects user feedback across multiple platforms including Slack, Intercom, Trustpilot, G2, and ProductHunt.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-18\",\n    \"category\": \"AI workflow automation\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"$24/mo flat is solid too. Most tools in this space charge per seat which gets painful fast.\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GitAgent by Lyzr\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/gitagent-2\",\n    \"description\": \"Git-native open standard that transforms your repository into your AI agent's memory, skills, and identity. Define once and run anywhere.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-19\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow orchestration agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"Store agents in Git. Version them. Port them. Run them anywhere.\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Claude Code Channels\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/claude-code-channels\",\n    \"description\": \"Control your local Claude Code sessions remotely via Telegram and Discord. Built on Model Context Protocol (MCP).\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-20\",\n    \"category\": \"AI workflow automation\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"Leverages MCP's new claude/channel capability type\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Claude Code Scheduled Tasks\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/claude-code-scheduled-tasks\",\n    \"description\": \"Schedule recurring coding tasks with Claude Code across local desktop and cloud for automated execution.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-22\",\n    \"category\": \"AI workflow automation\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  }\n]",
    "newString": "[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"JetBrains Air\",\n    \"url\": \"https://blog.jetbrains.com/air/2026/03/air-launches-as-public-preview-a-new-wave-of-dev-tooling-built-on-26-years-of-experience/\",\n    \"description\": \"Agentic development environment that allows delegating coding tasks to multiple AI agents that can run concurrently. Built on 26 years of JetBrains development experience, representing a new wave of AI-first dev tooling.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-16\",\n    \"category\": \"AI IDE\",\n    \"sources\": [\"JetBrains Blog\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"InsForge\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/insforge-alpha\",\n    \"description\": \"Backend infrastructure built specifically for AI coding agents to ship full-stack applications. Provides authentication, database, storage, functions, and AI integration with zero manual configuration.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-11\",\n    \"category\": \"AI agent infrastructure\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"Reached #1 Product Hunt\", \"~3,600 GitHub stars post-launch\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/minimax\",\n    \"description\": \"Self-evolving AI model powering autonomous agents - achieves 56.22% on SWE-Pro benchmark with 100 TPS speed and strong software engineering capabilities.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-19\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding model\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"390 points on Product Hunt\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"OpenUI\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/openui\",\n    \"description\": \"The open standard for Generative UI - accelerates UI development by crafting live UI from ideas that can be converted to React, Svelte, and other frameworks.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-11\",\n    \"category\": \"AI code generation\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"352 upvotes on Product Hunt\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"InfrOS\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/infros\",\n    \"description\": \"Predict and validate cloud architectures before launch - designs and validates inherently optimized cloud architectures that align to team priorities.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-19\",\n    \"category\": \"AI workflow automation\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"292 upvotes on Product Hunt\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GitAgent by Lyzr\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/gitagent-2\",\n    \"description\": \"Git-native open standard that transforms your repository into your AI agent's memory, skills, and identity. Define once and run anywhere from GitHub into Claude, OpenAI, CrewAI, OpenClaw without reformatting.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-19\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow orchestration agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"Store agents in Git. Version them. Port them. Run them anywhere.\", \"Using the repo itself as the agent's memory makes way more sense than dumping everything into a system prompt.\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Firecrawl CLI\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/extract-by-firecrawl\",\n    \"description\": \"Complete web data toolkit for AI agents and developers - CLI tool for web scraping and data extraction specifically designed for AI/LLM applications and RAG.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-11\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"assistant-ui react-ink\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.assistant-ui.com/blog/2026-03-launch-week\",\n    \"description\": \"Terminal UI bindings powered by Ink for building AI chat interfaces in the terminal - enabling developers to build AI chat for CLI applications.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-11\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Official Blog\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Budibase AI Agents\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/budibase\",\n    \"description\": \"Open source AI agents that run your operations - handle requests, approvals, and workflows automatically connected to your data and tools.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-19\",\n    \"category\": \"open-source AI agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Claude Code Channels\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/claude-code-channels\",\n    \"description\": \"Control your local Claude Code sessions remotely via Telegram and Discord. Built on Model Context Protocol (MCP), enables sending commands and receiving CI alerts from your phone while Claude Code executes tasks locally.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-20\",\n    \"category\": \"AI workflow automation\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"Leverages MCP's new claude/channel capability type to turn messaging platforms into tool servers\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Claude Code Scheduled Tasks\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/claude-code-scheduled-tasks\",\n    \"description\": \"Schedule recurring coding tasks with Claude Code across local desktop and cloud. Set repos, schedules, and prompts once for automated execution. Ideal for continuous workflows and agent-like development.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-22\",\n    \"category\": \"AI workflow automation\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ChatML\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/chatml\",\n    \"description\": \"Cockpit for Claude Code - visualization and management tool to see everything your agents build, providing oversight for AI coding agents.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-19\",\n    \"category\": \"AI workflow automation\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"AI Skills Manager\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/ai-skills-manager\",\n    \"description\": \"One desktop app to browse, install, enable, and share AI agent skills across all major coding agents.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-20\",\n    \"category\": \"AI workflow automation\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"AISafe - Source Code Audit\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/aisafe-source-code-audit\",\n    \"description\": \"AI-powered source code auditing and security testing tool for automated code security analysis.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-03-19\",\n    \"category\": \"AI code security\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  }\n]",
